{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"上半屏最上方的第一块超大号白色文字，尤其是“忘了藏好喜欢”“对方已经看出他有多在乎”；随后视线容易被下面两块同样醒目的白色大字吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他没藏住自己的喜欢，对方已经看出他很在乎。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"喜欢、在乎；被看穿之后具体是失落、忐忑还是不安，第一眼不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"对方看出心意后，他心里空落落的，不知道怎么继续相处；担心对方嫌自己太黏，原本熟悉的亲近感也变得有距离。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的字争夺主视线，第一块之后还有两块同样醒目的大字。\",\n    \"单块太长，一块里有好几层意思，快速扫视难以完整接收。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里，要拼起第一块的心意暴露、第二块的失落无措和第三块的担心疏远，才能理解完整的处境与感受。\",\n    \"第二块下方还有一串较小的蓝色短语，需要在多条信息之间挑选。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "27b4cdd7-af35-4811-9116-75f5039004a3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T030057086710Z", "elapsed_seconds": 34.906, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:01:31.988298+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f1a9f6e4206eee6da8855948ad06182b9295aa6a2d4a717009d91fd1169093f2", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f